              <td class="py-3 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">Full detail in a shared room</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-lavender-100">
              <th scope="row" class="py-3 pr-4 font-heading font-semibold text-ink text-sm">Adjustments</th>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">Verbal cues and demonstration</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">Immediate, with hands-on help if welcome</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-lavender-100">
              <th scope="row" class="py-3 pr-4 font-heading font-semibold text-ink text-sm">Travel</th>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">None</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">Time to and from each lesson</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-lavender-100">
              <th scope="row" class="py-3 pr-4 font-heading font-semibold text-ink text-sm">Home setup</th>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">A quiet space, a camera, and a steady connection</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-base text-ink/70 font-light">Nothing beyond your instrument</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-lavender-100">
