      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">In-person lessons may be the better place to start if:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 pl-5 list-none">
        {[
          "The student is a young child who learns best through movement and gentle physical guidance",
          "You'd like close, every-angle attention to setup while first habits are forming",
